            <p style="margin:0 0 30px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(15,15,18,0.70);max-width:440px;text-wrap:pretty;">Every dot is a real search run from a real spot on the map. Red means the search happened and the business didn't come up — they were there, they just weren't the answer.</p>
            <rz-orb-button href={u("/contact/")} height="52" padding="30">See your own coverage</rz-orb-button>
          </div>

          <div style="grid-column:7 / span 6;">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-end;gap:22px;margin-bottom:10px;">
